          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "ComfyUI raises $30M at $500M valuation as creators demand more control over AI-generated media",
            "articleSection": "How to Evolve",
            "abstract": "ComfyUI, a platform that gives creators granular control over AI-generated image, video, and audio output, has raised $30 million in new funding at a $500 million valuation. The round signals growing investor conviction that professional and semi-professional creators want fine-grained tools rather than fully automated black-box AI generators. ComfyUI's node-based workflow system has attracted a large open-source community before this funding round. The company plans to use the capital to expand its tooling and enterprise offering.",
            "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/24/comfyui-hits-500m-valuation-as-creators-seek-more-control-over-ai-generated-media/",
            "publisher": {
